[6:55AM] 
#IkoroduRd
#TrafficUpdate

Traffic is looking good this morning exiting Ketu bus stop towards Ojota , New Garage, Maryland/Independence Tunnel all the way to Fadeyi.

The return journey from Dormanlong bridge through Fadeyi back to Ojota is free as well.
Just a bit slow approaching the Interchange (Tsunami) to connect Tollgate.

Moving ahead to Ketu and Mile 12 is better.
